@auth_api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5299

### Sign up
POST {{auth_api_HostAddress}}/api/account/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "testuser",
  "password": "secret"
}

### Log in (returns userName + JWT token)
POST {{auth_api_HostAddress}}/api/account/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "secret"
}

###
